                    <msContents>
                        
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
                            <locus from="3r" to="76v"/>
                            <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2314senafe">The Beauty of the Creation</title>
                            <explicit xml:lang="am">ድል፡ መነሣቱ፤ በመስቀል፡ ነውና፤ ምነው፡ በዕለተ፡ ዓርብ፡ ወረደ፤ ቢሉ። ኋላ፡ ፍጹም፡ ጥፍአቱ፡ በዕለተ፡ ዓርብ፡ ነውና፤ 
                                ተፈጸመ፡ ስነ፡ ፍጥረት፤ በሰላመ፤ እግዚአብሔር፡ ዘሎቱ፡ ስብሐት፤ ወጸጋሁ፤ ተሀሉ፤ ምስለ፤ ኃጥእ፡<del rend="erasure"/></explicit>
                            <note>The name of the supplicant has been erased and is illegible.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="am" otherLangs="gez"/>
                            </msItem>
                        
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i2">
                            <locus from="77r" to="77v"/>
                            <title type="incomplete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2839RepCh123">Malkǝʾ-hymn to Jesus </title>
                            <note>The text ends abruptly with the repetition of the opening words: <q><sic>ሰለም</sic>፡ ለዝክረ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ስምከ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> <choice><corr resp="bm:GrebTiss1935Codices">ስመ፡</corr><sic> ስም</sic></choice><supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> መሃላ፡ ዘ<gap reason="omitted"/></q></note>
                            <textLang mainLang="gez"/>   
                        </msItem>
                        
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i3">
                            <locus from="77v" to="79r"/>
                            <title type="complete" ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/NAR0004comput">Computation of the cycles of years according to several calendars</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="am">እምፍጥረተ፡ ዓለም፡ <choice><sic>አስከ፡</sic><corr>እስከ</corr></choice>፡ ኅልቀተ፡ ዓለም፡ ፯ሽህ፡ ከ፱፻ከ፳ዓመት፡ ነው፡ በዕለት፡ ቢገቡት፡ ፫፻፷፭ይሆናል፡</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="am">ድርገት፡ ሲወርድ፡ ቃጭል፡ መመታቱ፡ ስለ<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ምን፡ ነው፡ ቢሉ፡ ዮሐንስ፡ ወንጌላዊ፡ ክርስቶስን፡ ሲቀብሩ፡ አይቶ፡ አንዳለቀሰ፡ ነው፡</explicit>
                             <textLang mainLang="am"/>       
                        </msItem>
                        
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i4">
                            <locus target="#79r"/>
                            <title type="complete">A short note of theological-philosophical content</title>
                           <incipit xml:lang="am">ሰው፡ በ፪ነገር፡ ይጠቅማል፡ ምግብ፡ ማወቂያ፡ በመሆን፡ ለመላእክት፡ ግን፡ ማወቂያ፡ ብቻ፡ ነው፡ <choice><sic>ጥቅማቼውም፡</sic><corr>ጥቅማቸው፡</corr></choice>እርሱን፡ ማወቅ፡ ነው፡ ፍጹም፡ ትፍሥሕት፡ <expan><abbr>ፍ</abbr><ex>ጹም</ex></expan>፡ ተድላ፡ <del>ይ</del>፡ ነው፡</incipit>
                            <explicit xml:lang="am">ምድረ፡ ብርኅተ፡ ወጽእዱተ፡ ይወርሱ፡ ጻድቃን፡ እንዳለ። በእሳት፡ ምድርን፡ እያስመታ፡ አጸና፡ ያን<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ጊዜ፡ ከይቡስ፡ እሳት፡ ከርጡብ፡ ምድር፡ ደመና፡ ወጻ፡</explicit>
                            <note>This (and possibly also  the subsequent) note is written in a different hand.</note>
                            <textLang mainLang="am"/>        
                        </msItem>
                        
                        <msItem xml:id="ms_i5">
                            <locus target="#79r"/>
                            <title type="complete">A short note on counting epagomenal days</title>
                            <incipit xml:lang="am"><sic>ጳጉሜ<supplied reason="omitted">ን</supplied></sic>፡ <add place="above">፫</add>፼ከ፯ሺህ፡ ፱፻፵፭<supplied reason="omitted">፡</supplied> ነው፤ 
                                <sic>ጳግሜ<supplied reason="omitted">ን</supplied></sic>፡ ሽህ፡ ከ፰፻፵፯፡ ነ<supplied reason="omitted">ው</supplied>፡ ዕለቱ፡ ፵፩፼ከ፯ሽህ፡ ከ<add place="above">፫</add>፻፳፭፡ <expan><abbr>ነ</abbr><ex>ው</ex></expan>፡  ፻፯ዕለታት፡ <sic>ቁጽር</sic>፡ ፪፻ከ፺፩፼ከ፬ሽህ<supplied reason="omitted">።</supplied> </incipit>
                            <textLang mainLang="am"/>   
                        </msItem>
                        
                    
                    </msContents>
                    
